tZlWQCR0jH53cKO0oxQ&_hsmi=3D392307803 ) =E2=80=94 a baby gear rental servic=
e =E2=80=94 will clean items including car seats, strollers, high chairs, a=
nd more. Basic cleans, which include 30 minutes of vacuuming and wiping dow=
n, are ~$20, while a full 90-minute deep clean is ~$80.

- Buckle Bath (https://www.bucklebathbrooklyn.com/?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz--1yH_hN=
qp0e642PLhEem6AWC7gDo6rn3H_c5k8HPAUFCWsngVMKki3e7_wVDUvdp68_JwtUZztZlWQCR0j=
H53cKO0oxQ&_hsmi=3D392307803 ) services New York and New Jersey with plans =
for future franchising. Cleaning starts at $69 per car seat, and the compan=
y also partners with preschools and daycares for on-site cleaning.

Niche cleaning services=E2=80=A6

=E2=80=A6 work because they provide a service that most people can=E2=80=99=
t or don=E2=80=99t want to do.

That applies to forensic and crime scene cleaners, of course, but also thos=
e that specialize in rugs and fabrics, pools, chimneys, air ducts and vents=
, and natural disasters where there may have been fires or flooding damage.

But car seat cleaners are tapping into a specific demographic: busy parents=
 who don=E2=80=99t have time to deep clean their own car seats even if they=
 want to. And that=E2=80=99s a ripe market:

- Sherah (https://richmondbizsense.com/2025/11/18/personal-assistant-startu=
p-sherah-launches-app-abandons-capital-raise/?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz--1yH_hNqp0e6=
42PLhEem6AWC7gDo6rn3H_c5k8HPAUFCWsngVMKki3e7_wVDUvdp68_JwtUZztZlWQCR0jH53cK=
O0oxQ&_hsmi=3D392307803 ) is a platform that connects working moms to assis=
tants who complete tasks, like booking appointments.

- Otter matches (https://www.thebump.com/news/otter-childcare?_hsenc=3Dp2AN=
qtz--1yH_hNqp0e642PLhEem6AWC7gDo6rn3H_c5k8HPAUFCWsngVMKki3e7_wVDUvdp68_JwtU=
ZztZlWQCR0jH53cKO0oxQ&_hsmi=3D392307803 ) working parents looking for sitte=
rs to stay-at-home parents looking for a side hustle.

- Little Spoon (https://www.littlespoon.com/?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz--1yH_hNqp0e64=
2PLhEem6AWC7gDo6rn3H_c5k8HPAUFCWsngVMKki3e7_wVDUvdp68_JwtUZztZlWQCR0jH53cKO=
0oxQ&_hsmi=3D392307803 ) is a meal prep service for babies and toddlers.

- Peanut (https://www.peanut-app.io/?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz--1yH_hNqp0e642PLhEem6=
AWC7gDo6rn3H_c5k8HPAUFCWsngVMKki3e7_wVDUvdp68_JwtUZztZlWQCR0jH53cKO0oxQ&_hs=
mi=3D392307803 ) matches moms looking for friends and communities.

- And finally, here=E2=80=99s a fun one: Cradlewise (https://cradlewise.com=
/?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz--1yH_hNqp0e642PLhEem6AWC7gDo6rn3H_c5k8HPAUFCWsngVMKki3e7=
