NEWSWORTHY NUMBER

How much some New Yorkers will receive in crypto as part of a cash transfer=
 pilot program funded by nonprofit GiveDirectly through donations from Coin=
base. The digital funds are being distributed to 160 low-income residents i=
n NYC, where the crypto ecosystem is more supported compared to other citie=
s, through February, per (https://www.businessinsider.com/coinbase-crypto-c=
ash-transfer-program-nyc-basic-income-ubi-2025-11?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz--1yH_hNq=
