53cKO0oxQ&_hsmi=3D392307803 ) Business Insider.

The initiative is similar to guaranteed basic income programs being trialed=
 around the US and globally. What sets it apart is the $8k lump sum partici=
pants received in November, which will help them invest in more substantial=
 things like housing and education, according to GiveDirectly, and, given t=
he timing, maybe even a present or two. =E2=80=98Tis the season, right?

