<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: =
22px;">Good news for parents who don=E2=80=99t want to clean slushie vomit<=
/span><br><br>They say successful businesses start by identifying a problem=
 and finding a way to solve it. For this small business, that problem is st=
icky car seats. <br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Young children are required by law to ride in=
 car seats, but given their propensity to spill snacks, drinks, and general=
ly make a mess, those car seats can often become dirty and sticky. <br><br>=
</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/=
UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWR0nc6nLbFkW5zXC_v4Vgj4QW2sbCLr5GxGKMN2x86xz2-ZW0W5BW0B06l=
Z3m-W5JFLcH3wSv4gW30H7Dm95CcJ4W3d1mkR5cMHnyW6w3Shl1gxXDZW86457j1krqLMVm5GR8=
27qqj5W81K_ft7k1MxcW108K_04zzPZ1N7FCvn5RBTjqVjckxn3DWN_JW51c4TJ33D8t7W8mlv_=
C5LwNvnW4mwv1P2FkqlQW7qc_Yd743JSQW4p6DWS2NnL87W8mLD5c4xyGrNN5nrT-gYv37-W5S_=
wKp3gDdGJf4CKvwq04" rel=3D"noopener" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-i=
d=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"AxZ9PFyB" target=3D"_blank">Seat Spa,</a> an =
Owensboro, Kentucky, business, will clean them for you, <a href=3D"https://=
media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWR0nc6nLbFkW5zXC_v4Vgj4QW2sbCLr5=
GxGKMN2x86z22-ZW0W8wLKSR6lZ3m4W8s8Hwz9l7Z6KW7TF8RD3bnzkPW4Y7Hz-2TfRlbW1ML98=
